175 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 128 0 R
/E (Agriculture is the backbone of our economy, yet many farmers face challenges due to lack of timely information about crop diseases, weather conditions, and proper treatment methods. At the same time, many young individuals are interested in agriculture but lack practical knowledge and guidance.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [18]
>>
endobj
176 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 128 0 R
/E (To address these challenges, UVION is developed as an AI-powered smart farming assistant that supports both farmers and aspiring agricultural youth. For farmers, UVION acts as a digital expert by offering complete information about their crops, including disease detection, environmental analysis \(temperature and humidity\), severity levels, and personalized treatment and fertilizer recommendations. For youth interested in agriculture, UVION serves as a learning platform by explaining how diseases occur, how different weather conditions affect crops, and what actions should be taken at each stage of plant growth. It bridges the gap between traditional farming knowledge and modern technology, encouraging smart and sustainable farming practices.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [19]
>>
endobj
177 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 128 0 R
/E (By combining AI, environmental data, and intelligent recommendations, UVION transforms agriculture into a more accessible, informative, and technology-driven field for both experienced farmers and the next generation.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [20]
>>
endobj
