/E (UVION uses a modular architecture where plant images, crop details, and environmental data are given as inputs. The backend processes this data using a CNN model and environmental analysis, and a central decision engine generates insights, recommendations, and explanations. The results are then displayed through a user-friendly interface, enabling real-time crop monitoring and guidance.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
216 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 133 0 R
/E (UVION follows a modular and layered architecture that integrates data input, intelligent processing, and user interaction into a single workflow. The system begins with user inputs, where plant images are uploaded and basic crop details such as type and growth stage are provided. In parallel, environmental data such as temperature and humidity is collected either through APIs or predefined conditions.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
